        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>4.语法</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = {\n  tex: { inlineMath: [['$','$']], displayMath: [['$$','$$']] }\n};\n</script>\n<script id=\"MathJax-script\" async src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n<style>\n  html, body {\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 0;\n    background: #7cae94;\n  }\n  body {\n    font-family: \"Kaiti SC\", \"KaiTi\", \"STKaiti\", \"Yuanti SC\", serif;\n  }\n  .page {\n    position: relative;\n    width: 540px;\n    min-height: 720px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    background: #7cae94;\n    padding: 26px 26px 26px 26px;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n  }\n  .notepad {\n    position: relative;\n    background: #ffffff;\n    background-image:\n      linear-gradient(to right, rgba(120,150,135,0.18) 1px, transparent 1px),\n      linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(120,150,135,0.18) 1px, transparent 1px);\n    background-size: 18px 18px;\n    min-height: 668px;\n    padding: 46px 34px 40px 34px;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n    overflow: hidden;\n  }\n  /* spiral binding holes at the top of the notepad */\n  .binding {\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 12px;\n    left: 0;\n    width: 100%;\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: center;\n    gap: 18px;\n  }\n  .binding span {\n    display: block;\n    width: 17px;\n    height: 17px;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    background: #7cae94;\n  }\n  h1.title {\n    font-size: 40px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    text-align: center;\n    margin: 26px 0 22px 0;\n    letter-spacing: 1px;\n  }\n  p.para {\n    font-size: 20.5px;\n    line-height: 1.72;\n    text-align: center;\n    margin: 0 0 26px 0;\n    letter-spacing: 0.5px;\n  }\n  /* decorative doodle placeholders positioned as in the original */\n  .placeholder {\n    position: absolute;\n    color: #b9b9b9;\n    font-size: 9px;\n    text-align: center;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n  }\n  .star1 {\n    top: 196px;\n    left: 60px;\n    width: 34px;\n    height: 34px;\n    line-height: 34px;\n  }\n  .star2 {\n    top: 566px;\n    left: 62px;\n    width: 40px;\n    height: 40px;\n    line-height: 40px;\n  }\n  .flower {\n    bottom: 8px;\n    right: 10px;\n    width: 90px;\n    height: 90px;\n    line-height: 90px;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <div class=\"page\">\n    <div class=\"notepad\">\n      <div class=\"binding\">\n        <span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span>\n        <span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span>\n      </div>\n\n      <h1 class=\"title\">4.语法</h1>\n\n      <p class=\"para\">语法是语言的框架。光知道单词却不懂语法，你就无法完整地说出一个句子，有时候还可能让人产生误解；单词都认识，但是凑在一起就不知道句子是什么意思，也会感到尴尬。</p>\n\n      <p class=\"para\">虽然提起学语法，大家都是感觉头都大，各种时态错综复杂怎么记？但是任何一门学科都是由浅入深的，英语也不例外。</p>\n\n      <p class=\"para\">学习语法就像造房子，首先要把基础的语法脉络理清，打好根基，之后再慢慢补充和拓展，让知识巩固起来。</p>\n\n      <p class=\"para\">零基础的同学在学习英语语法时可以先从简单的开始。比如五大基本句型和八大时态等。</p>\n\n      <div class=\"placeholder star1\">[Doodle: star, left of paragraph 1]</div>\n      <div class=\"placeholder star2\">[Doodle: star, bottom-left]</div>\n      <div class=\"placeholder flower\">[Doodle: flower, bottom-right]</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</body>\n</html>"
